  "description": "A fat body type leads to a hellish military life due to sexual harassment from Yu-Hyeok, a senior military officer. Even after discharge, the memories of military service are so traumatising that living a normal life is impossible. \n\nA familiar face appears on a recruitment poster. After seeing Yu-Heok, who ruined his life, living happily ever after, he decides to take revenge. That day, a plot to kidnap him and take revenge begins to unfold...\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated and edited)\n\n*Note:\n\\- This series is tagged with #L\\_이없는BL, which means BL without L(ove)\n\\- Reader discression is advised: this work contains disturbing themes, including kidnapping, rape, imprisonment, and murder\n\\- Chapter count includes an epilogue*",
